        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 302,
        "headingId": 779,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> a nodule consisting of ectatic dermal vascular channels with prominent papillary projections lined by endothelial cells with frequent intracytoplasmic eosinophilic globules.</p>\r\n",
